<BaseLayout title="Projects | Shubham Gade" description="Selected research projects in precision agriculture, climate services and geospatial agricultural intelligence.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Projects</div><h1>Research translated into projects and collaborations.</h1><p class="lead">Selected work spanning doctoral research, digital climate services and geospatial agricultural intelligence.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section compact"><div class="container">
    <article class="project-detail" id="phd"><div><div class="meta">2023–Present · AIT, Thailand</div></div><div><h2>Doctoral Research · Smart Greenhouse Precision Agriculture</h2><p>My doctoral research integrates irrigation management, biochar, nitrogen variability and advanced imaging approaches to improve crop productivity, resource-use efficiency and crop-stress monitoring in bell pepper.</p><div class="project-facts"><div class="fact"><small>Role</small><strong>PhD Researcher</strong></div><div class="fact"><small>Focus</small><strong>Water · Nutrients · Crop sensing</strong></div><div class="fact"><small>Methods</small><strong>RGB · Thermal · Multispectral · ML</strong></div></div><div class="project-note"><strong>Research components</strong><p>Irrigation × biochar; crop-water-stress sensing; nitrogen × biochar; and multispectral/ML-based nutrient assessment.</p></div></div></article>
    <article class="project-detail" id="afas"><div><div class="meta">2024–2027 · Thailand & Vietnam</div></div><div><h2>AFAS · Agrometeorological Forecasts & Advisories</h2><p>Collaborative work on agrometeorological forecasts and digital advisories delivered through mobile applications and social media to support climate-smart agricultural decision-making in Thailand and Vietnam.</p><div class="project-facts"><div class="fact"><small>Role</small><strong>Research Assistant</strong></div><div class="fact"><small>Theme</small><strong>Climate services</strong></div><div class="fact"><small>Approach</small><strong>Digital advisory · Farmer decision support</strong></div></div><div class="project-note"><strong>Project contribution</strong><p>Research support for climate and agronomic information services, digital adoption and farmer-oriented advisory delivery.</p></div></div></article>
    <article class="project-detail" id="asis"><div><div class="meta">2021–2023 · ICAR-NIASM, India</div></div><div><h2>ASIS · Abiotic Stress Information System</h2><p>Geospatial research supporting the Abiotic Stress Information System (ASIS), a centralized web resource for geospatial-temporal information on agricultural abiotic stressors, associated parameters and management options.</p><div class="project-facts"><div class="fact"><small>Role</small><strong>Young Professional-II</strong></div><div class="fact"><small>Tools</small><strong>GEE · GIS · Sentinel-2</strong></div><div class="fact"><small>Applications</small><strong>Portal data · Mapping · Deep learning</strong></div></div><div class="project-note"><strong>Portal & data contribution</strong><p>I contributed datasets and geospatial outputs used in the ASIS portal, including soil fertility and nutrient indices, GHG estimates, Earth-observation analyses and AI-assisted farm-pond identification. The official ASIS Team page lists me as Young Professional-II.</p><a class="btn project-external" href="https://niam.res.in/asis/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit official ASIS portal ↗</a></div></div></article>
  </div></section>
